    "6:_": "(Section VI) In the Haga, there is not even a stay for the analysis and testing to begin. P.S. Look at the Maga DKIL 44 and here Garsinan in Yerushalmi there Tamman said Ba Ze'ev, etc. and look at the compositions of Yom Tov clothing on the Egg tract which has already been copied and sorted. There I wrote an explanation of the Jerusalem language in this in two correct ways in Aza'i Ayash and well-documented:",
    "3:_": "(name of section 12) The slaughterer of an animal in the Yot is not allowed to tear the wool, etc. P.S. Refer to the MGA and AMS in its explanation in Aza'i in my answer to the Jud C. Ra'u in the SAT in the answer to the state of Ongrin, according to and DOK:",
    "4:_": "(Same seif 19) One slaughtered animal and chaya and their bloods mixed, etc. See Taz sk 21 end in name of Rishon L'Tzion and what Taz challenged on him. Besides what I wondered on him in my compositions, I also wondered in omissions in Mei Niddah laws of mikvaot from Zevachim 80 on 'there is mixing', Makos 4 on barrels fallen into the Great Sea, and Rambam chapter 6 mikvaot law Yoreh Deah — see there. I also wondered on Taz — what proof from mixtures? behold dry in dry is also nullified — see there where I extended this, investigate; also see my composition Orach Chayim year 1922 Avodah Zarah laws of Pesach siman 448 in my responsa to the holy community Yarbrov where I settled Taz's question on Maharshal — see there and investigate; also my composition Yoreh Deah edition 5 siman 493 where I brought proof for Maharshal's words from gemara Chullin chapter 35 daf 98b — see there and investigate."
